  "description": "<p>I wasn't able to perform a sanity build (mvn clean install) in Windows 10 due to some integration tests in fcrepo-kernel-modeshape failing.  A few of them were failing because the last modified date for binaries was not updating all of the time (tests were flapping).  This seems to affect only non-hyper-visor based windows install. <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" data-account-id=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" accountid=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Ben Pennell</a>,  <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5ed02cb2dacd410c1f9e56ae\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5ed02cb2dacd410c1f9e56ae\" data-account-id=\"5ed02cb2dacd410c1f9e56ae\" accountid=\"5ed02cb2dacd410c1f9e56ae\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Aaron Birkland</a> and <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3Acc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:cc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" data-account-id=\"557058:cc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" accountid=\"557058:cc6016b1-6dae-4b52-922c-9076d2e8b96d\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Yinlin Chen</a> have wrestled with the issue.</p>",
